<title>HONG KONG: NatMut Funds Mgmt to launch HK/China growth fund.</title>
<headline>NatMut Funds Mgmt to launch HK/China growth fund.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based National Mutual Funds Management (Asia) said it will launch a new fund on Monday focusing on small to medium sized companies doing business in Hong Kong and China.</p>
<p>The NM Hong Kong and China Growth Fund will be part of the NM Asian Select umbrella funds launched in October.</p>
<p>National Mutual Funds Management (Asia), a subsidiary of National Mutual Holdings which is part of the AXA Group, has assets of nearly US$2 billion under management.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6441</p>
